  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-git-plugin",
      "text": "English · [简体中文](README_ZH.md)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"./assets/readme/hero.svg\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Git in your DeepSeek Harness session: inspect, branch, commit and keep a recoverable snapshot\">\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-git-plugin",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-git-plugin\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/v/dsh-git-plugin?style=flat-square&amp;color=E76F51\" alt=\"npm version\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/MashedPotato817/dsh-git-plugin/actions/workflows/ci.yml\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MashedPotato817/dsh-git-plugin/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg?branch=main\" alt=\"CI on main\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-git-plugin\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/dm/dsh-git-plugin?style=flat-square&amp;color=218C74\" alt=\"npm downloads\"></a>\n  <a href=\"./LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-218C74?style=flat-square\" alt=\"MIT license\"></a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-git-plugin",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"#install\">Install</a> · <a href=\"#use\">Use</a> · <a href=\"#docs-and-feedback\">Docs & feedback</a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Keep Git in your DSH session",
      "text": "Inspect changes, create branches, run pre-commit checks, and keep recoverable snapshots. **Web Git panel + 5 slash commands + 4 read-only model tools** give you and your agent the same view of the repository.\n\n- **See the changes** — branch, working tree, staged / unstaged diff, and history.\n- **Commit with checks** — branch and commit directly in your session.\n- **Keep a snapshot** — stash current changes, then list or restore them."
    },
    {
      "section": "Keep Git in your DSH session",
      "text": "Version: **0.4.0**. Verified host: **DSH 0.2.0-rc.2**. Requires Node.js ≥20 and Git ≥2.32. [Compatibility and validation](CONTRIBUTING.md#compatibility-and-validation)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Use your active profile; replace `web` as needed:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-git-plugin@0.4.0\n```\n\nNew installations register the plugin automatically. Restart that profile's DSH process and refresh the browser when using Web.\n\nUpgrading a manually enabled 0.2.0 profile? Follow the [migration steps](docs/marketplace-submission.md#从手工启用的-020-迁移) to avoid duplicate registration. [Fixed GitHub tag and source installation](CONTRIBUTING.md#other-installation-methods)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Git in the Web sidebar",
      "text": "Open a repository workspace/session, expand the right sidebar and select **Git**. See branch/file states, switch between staged and unstaged diffs, and browse commit history/detail. Stage selected files or all changes, commit only the index, manage branches/stashes, and restore files with a retained backup. Every write opens a preview and requires your confirmation. [Panel guide](docs/web-panel.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Git in the Web sidebar",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MashedPotato817/dsh-git-plugin/main/docs/images/git-actions-dark.png\" width=\"343\" alt=\"Actual DSH Web Git action panel in a disposable test repository\">\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "```text\n/status\n/diff\n/branch feat/my-change\n/commit feat: 完成一项修改\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `/status` | Current branch and working-tree status |\n| `/diff` | Staged and unstaged change summaries |\n| `/branch [<name>]` | List branches, or create and switch |\n| `/commit [<message>]` | Show commit guidance, or run checks and commit |\n| `/undo [list\\|pop]` | Create, list, or restore stash snapshots |\n\nThe model can use `git-status`, `git-diff`, `git-log`, and `git-show`. For example:"
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "> Check Git status, diff, and the last five commits. Explain what is staged and what to verify before committing.\n\n**Commit scope:** the Web commit uses only staged changes. `/commit <message>` stages all changes in the target repository before committing. Check the scope first. Without a message it only shows guidance and changes.\n\n**Snapshots:** `/undo` stashes working-tree changes, including untracked files. It does not revert commits. Restoring with `pop` may produce conflicts."
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "Need longer timeouts or a test hook? See [configuration](CONTRIBUTING.md#configuration)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Docs and feedback",
      "text": "- [Contributing](CONTRIBUTING.md) · configuration, source installation, development and validation\n- [CHANGELOG](CHANGELOG.md) · release changes\n- [Issues](https://github.com/MashedPotato817/dsh-git-plugin/issues) · bugs and feature requests\n- [Market submission](docs/marketplace-submission.md) · catalog progress (Chinese audit record)\n- [Web panel](docs/web-panel.md) · development preview and validation\n- [Maintenance instructions](AGENTS.md) · engineering constraints"
    },
    {
      "section": "Docs and feedback",
      "text": "Version 0.4.0 completes the Git operation panel requested in Issue #1. Market inclusion is tracked separately. Presentation inspired by [dsh-agent-teams](https://github.com/NanmiCoder/dsh-agent-teams); the SVG banner is original."
    },
